- Use Shopify CLI for project setup and management
- Leverage the Dawn theme for code examples and best practices
- Organize code using sections and snippets for modularity
- Optimize performance by minimizing Liquid logic and using static content where possible
- Follow Shopify's design best practices for consistent user experience
- Prefer using TailwindCSS over CSS when creating new section/snippets, using rem instead of px